nd telling me where the villa alarm went?\", \"Would you mind showing me the actual password, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0027\", \"v\": [[\"Could you take Pieter in the Gitedale trip group and settle up with them, please?\", \"Separately, would you pull up the crate booking thing for me?\", \"Could you please mark the paddle to-do as complete?\", \"Would you find anything mentioning cinder among my shots, please?\", \"And what about harp, please?\", \"Could you put it in the Gitedale 2025 album, please?\"], [\"umm so Pieter, on the Gitedale trip… can we just settle up?\", \"oh and uh, can you pull up that crate booking thing?\", \"ok and the paddle to-do, can you mark that as, um, done — complete?\", \"uh which ones say cinder in the… the shots?\", \"hmm what about harp?\", \"ok stick that in the Gitedale 2025 album, would you?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0028\", \"v\": [[\"five dollars, Pieter's tickets, Gitedale trip — I paid\"], [\"Could you please add five dollars for Pieter's tickets to the Gitedale trip? I paid for them.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0029\", \"v\": [[\"how many Gitedale trip pics?\"], [\"umm how many photos did I, uh, take on the Gitedale trip?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0030\", \"v\": [[\"what pics r in the Brewing album\", \"also book in a vet appointment next monday at half nine pls\", \"diff thing, can u find the Xochitl notes\", \"what about Maskan?\", \"n what does my to-do list have on it\", \"move the second one to monday thx\"], [\"Could you tell me which pictures are in the Brewing album, please?\", \"On another note, would you book in a vet appointment next monday at half nine?\", \"Could you please find the Xochitl notes for me?\", \"And what about Maskan?\", \"Would you tell me what my to-do list has on that?\", \"Could you please move the second one to monday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0031\", \"v\": [[\"I was trying to remember a conversation from earlier in the week and it's bugging me — who did I have dinner with last monday?\", \"Different thing, I keep putting this off and should really get on with it: what's left to do on the ask einar plan?\", \"That's more than I expected, so could you narrow it down to just the ones from last month?\", \"Oh, and I think I binned the medallion photo by accident while tidying up — could you put it back for me?\", \"Last thing, I'd like to square things up with people soon — who do I still have to pay back?\"], [\"Could you tell me who I had dinner with last monday?\", \"On a different note, would you tell me what's left to do on the ask einar plan?\", \"Could you show me just the ones from last month, please?\", \"Would you mind restoring the medallion photo I deleted?\", \"Could you tell me who I still need to pay back, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0032\", \"v\": [[\"when do i have the Einar thing\", \"hang on, show me spending over sixteen dollars\", \"ok back to the Einar thing — anything on my to-do list about it too?\", \"whats the steps for it\", \"n what does my calendar have on it\"], [\"umm when do I have the, uh, the Einar thing?\", \"oh wait, hang on — can you show me the spending above sixteen dollars?\", \"ok sorry, back to Einar… is there anything on my to-do list about it too?\", \"and um, what are the steps for that?\", \"ok and what does my calendar, uh, have on it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0033\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's Takeshi's birthday again?\", \"ok different thing — what are the, uh, steps for the recycle?\", \"and what's the second one?\", \"oh and when do I have the Takeshi thing?\", \"hang on, quick one — what documents are in the Vehicle folder?\", \"right, going back to that event from before… who's coming to it?\"], [\"Takeshi birthday — when?\", \"recycle steps?\", \"what's the second one?\", \"when's the Takeshi thing?\", \"wait — Vehicle folder docs?\", \"back to that event — who's coming?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0034\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's that, uh, Takeshi walk of mine?\"], [\"I said I'd bring coffee along and I've completely lost track of the plan, so remind me — when is the Takeshi walk happening?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0035\", \"v\": [[\"umm what did I write yesterday in my, uh, journal?\", \"oh and can you settle up with Vymie Jansen in the cinder fund?\"], [\"Could you tell me what I wrote yesterday in my journal, please?\", \"Separately, would you mind settling up with Vymie Jansen in the cinder fund?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0036\", \"v\": [[\"who's Maskan?\", \"pics with either of them?\", \"just the favourites\"], [\"who is Maskan\", \"any pics with either of them in\", \"just the faves out of those pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0037\", \"v\": [[\"ok so, um, Pieter on the Gitedale trip… can we just settle up?\"], [\"can u do Pieter in Gitedale trip, wanna settle up\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0038\", \"v\": [[\"Just remembered I never logged this one — could you add three dollars for Pieter's lunch to the Gitedale trip? I paid for it.\", \"Also, I'm putting together a little slideshow for myself, so what pictures did I take while I was in Gitedale?\"], [\"Could you please add three dollars for Pieter's lunch to the Gitedale trip? I paid.\", \"On another note, could you show me the pictures I took while in Gitedale?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0039\", \"v\": [[\"event at Criness Allotments?\"], [\"is there anything on my calendar at Criness Allotments\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w18-0040\", \"v\": [[\"find the Emrys notes i wrote\", \"what about magnolia?\"], [\"umm can you find the Emrys notes, the ones I, uh, wrote?\", \"oh and what about magnolia?\"]]}","ttft_ms":29785,"type":"result","duration_ms":46940,"uuid":"3450bfca-917e-48a9-ac3f-62abc7b20544","ttft_stream_ms":1718,"time_to_request_ms":156,"first_content_frame_ms":1719,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22148345,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278698895.903,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
